                  <provenance><orgName role="fmo" key="mlgbOrg_122">Canterbury, Kent. Benedictine
                        abbey of St Augustine (originally of St Peter and St Paul)</orgName><p>Cambridge, Trinity College, MS 903, together with BL MSS
                        Egerton 823 and 840A, makes up all but the first three items of BA1.1599:
                        'Colecciones Iohannis de Lond' cum I.' John of London's hand occurs almost
                        certainly.</p></provenance>
